flowchart TD
  A[User Center - Order Detail] --> B[Click "Return / RMA"]
  B --> C[Submit RMA Form + Attachments]
  C --> API[POST /rma/create]
  API --> D[bjt_rma_ticket (status=Submitted)]
  D -->|Email| Staff[After-Sales Staff]
  Staff --> E[Admin RMA UI]
  E --> F[Change Status: Accepted / Rejected]
  F --> G[Process Return Logistics]
  G --> H[Update Status: In-Transit → Completed]
  H --> API2[PATCH /rma/:id]
  API2 --> D
  D -->|Status Webhook| FrontendUser[User Center]
  FrontendUser -->|Poll /rma/status| D 